{"hypotheses": [
  {
    "name": "Quality Minus Crowding",
    "mechanism": "Combining operating profitability (OperProf), gross profits (GP), and net payout yield (NetPayoutYield) as a quality anchor, and subtracting short interest (ShortInterest) isolates quality returns uncontaminated by crowding or consensus trades. This captures mispricing in neglected but profitable firms, beyond what each quality or sentiment primitive captures in isolation.",
    "expression": {
      "terms": [
        {"weight": 0.5, "primitive": "OperProf"},
        {"weight": 0.5, "primitive": "GP"},
        {"weight": 0.5, "primitive": "NetPayoutYield"},
        {"weight": -1.0, "primitive": "ShortInterest"}
      ],
      "regime": "MKT_TRAILING_12M_UP",
      "vol_target": true
    },
    "auxiliary_predictions": [
      {"type": "regime_interaction", "regime": "MKT_TRAILING_12M_DOWN", "direction": "lower"},
      {"type": "size_segment", "segment": "large", "direction": "stronger"},
      {"type": "correlation", "primitive": "OperProf", "bound": "below", "threshold": 0.3},
      {"type": "subperiod_consistency"}
    ],
    "expected_annualized_sharpe": 0.72,
    "expected_decay_half_life_months": 18
  },
  {
    "name": "Operating Momentum Uncrowded",
    "mechanism": "By combining intermediate momentum (IntMom) and revenue surprise (RevenueSurprise), then neutralizing analyst optimism (AOP), the composite sources operating momentum premia where analyst expectations are not already embedded, exploiting behavioral underreaction to new information beyond either component alone.",
    "expression": {
      "terms": [
        {"weight": 1.0, "primitive": "IntMom"},
        {"weight": 1.0, "primitive": "RevenueSurprise"},
        {"weight": -1.0, "primitive": "AOP"}
      ],
      "regime": null,
      "vol_target": true
    },
    "auxiliary_predictions": [
      {"type": "size_segment", "segment": "small", "direction": "stronger"},
      {"type": "regime_interaction", "regime": "VIX_BELOW_TRAILING_MEDIAN", "direction": "higher"},
      {"type": "correlation", "primitive": "IntMom", "bound": "below", "threshold": 0.3}
    ],
    "expected_annualized_sharpe": 0.65,
    "expected_decay_half_life_months": 12
  },
  {
    "name": "Low Leverage Efficient Growth",
    "mechanism": "Weighting gross profits (GP) and asset growth (AssetGrowth) positively while subtracting market leverage (Leverage) targets efficient growers—companies expanding profitably without overextending capital structure. This isolates returns from organic, sustainable growth, distinct from leverage-driven expansion.",
    "expression": {
      "terms": [
        {"weight": 0.5, "primitive": "GP"},
        {"weight": 0.5, "primitive": "AssetGrowth"},
        {"weight": -1.0, "primitive": "Leverage"}
      ],
      "regime": "TERM_SPREAD_POSITIVE",
      "vol_target": true
    },
    "auxiliary_predictions": [
      {"type": "regime_interaction", "regime": "TERM_SPREAD_NEGATIVE", "direction": "lower"},
      {"type": "international", "region": "developed_ex_us", "direction": "same_sign"},
      {"type": "correlation", "primitive": "AssetGrowth", "bound": "below", "threshold": 0.3}
    ],
    "expected_annualized_sharpe": 0.60,
    "expected_decay_half_life_months": 24
  },
  {
    "name": "Market Sentiment-Filtered Value",
    "mechanism": "Combining book-to-market (BM) and enterprise multiple (EntMult) as value, then subtracting the analyst revision (AnalystRevision) factor, delivers a value portfolio focused on stocks undervalued both on fundamentals and overlooked by analysts, capturing risk premia not fully arbitraged by consensus coverage.",
    "expression": {
      "terms": [
        {"weight": 0.5, "primitive": "BM"},
        {"weight": 0.5, "primitive": "EntMult"},
        {"weight": -1.0, "primitive": "AnalystRevision"}
      ],
      "regime": "VIX_ABOVE_TRAILING_MEDIAN",
      "vol_target": true
    },
    "auxiliary_predictions": [
      {"type": "regime_interaction", "regime": "VIX_BELOW_TRAILING_MEDIAN", "direction": "lower"},
      {"type": "size_segment", "segment": "micro", "direction": "stronger"},
      {"type": "correlation", "primitive": "BM", "bound": "below", "threshold": 0.3}
    ],
    "expected_annualized_sharpe": 0.68,
    "expected_decay_half_life_months": 20
  },
  {
    "name": "Residual Capital Efficiency",
    "mechanism": "Combining cash-based operating profitability (CBOperProf) and return-on-assets (roaq), and subtracting investment-to-revenue (Investment), isolates firms delivering high profitability per unit capital, after adjusting for aggressive investment. This targets returns from truly efficient capital users, not just high gross profitability.",
    "expression": {
      "terms": [
        {"weight": 1.0, "primitive": "CBOperProf"},
        {"weight": 1.0, "primitive": "roaq"},
        {"weight": -1.0, "primitive": "Investment"}
      ],
      "regime": null,
      "vol_target": true
    },
    "auxiliary_predictions": [
      {"type": "size_segment", "segment": "large", "direction": "stronger"},
      {"type": "regime_interaction", "regime": "MKT_TRAILING_12M_UP", "direction": "higher"},
      {"type": "correlation", "primitive": "roaq", "bound": "below", "threshold": 0.3}
    ],
    "expected_annualized_sharpe": 0.62,
    "expected_decay_half_life_months": 18
  },
  {
    "name": "Earnings Accruals Momentum",
    "mechanism": "This combines earnings surprise (EarningsSurprise), change in net working capital (ChNWC), and accruals (Accruals), to harness the momentum in earnings quality changes—where positive earnings news is supported by improving working capital management and conservative accruals, reducing the risk of reversals.",
    "expression": {
      "terms": [
        {"weight": 1.0, "primitive": "EarningsSurprise"},
        {"weight": 0.5, "primitive": "ChNWC"},
        {"weight": -0.5, "primitive": "Accruals"}
      ],
      "regime": "MKT_TRAILING_12M_UP",
      "vol_target": true
    },
    "auxiliary_predictions": [
      {"type": "regime_interaction", "regime": "MKT_TRAILING_12M_DOWN", "direction": "lower"},
      {"type": "size_segment", "segment": "small", "direction": "stronger"},
      {"type": "subperiod_consistency"}
    ],
    "expected_annualized_sharpe": 0.64,
    "expected_decay_half_life_months": 15
  },
  {
    "name": "Intangible-Driven Defensive Profitability",
    "mechanism": "Combining intangibles-based CF-to-price (IntanCFP) and R&D capital-to-assets (RDcap), subtracting CAPM beta (Beta), isolates profitable, defensively positioned firms with high intangible investment. This targets innovation-driven defensiveness, capturing a premium unavailable to simple profitability or low-beta strategies.",
    "expression": {
      "terms": [
        {"weight": 1.0, "primitive": "IntanCFP"},
        {"weight": 1.0, "primitive": "RDcap"},
        {"weight": -1.0, "primitive": "Beta"}
      ],
      "regime": null,
      "vol_target": true
    },
    "auxiliary_predictions": [
      {"type": "regime_interaction", "regime": "VIX_ABOVE_TRAILING_MEDIAN", "direction": "higher"},
      {"type": "international", "region": "emerging", "direction": "opposite_sign"},
      {"type": "size_segment", "segment": "mega", "direction": "stronger"}
    ],
    "expected_annualized_sharpe": 0.58,
    "expected_decay_half_life_months": 30
  },
  {
    "name": "Net Payout Reversal",
    "mechanism": "By combining net payout yield (NetPayoutYield) and short-term reversal (STreversal), and subtracting share issuance (ShareIss1Y), this composite targets overreaction to payout events, netting out mechanical issuance effects. It captures reversal premia in stocks with high net payouts not driven by dilutive issuance.",
    "expression": {
      "terms": [
        {"weight": 1.0, "primitive": "NetPayoutYield"},
        {"weight": 1.0, "primitive": "STreversal"},
        {"weight": -1.0, "primitive": "ShareIss1Y"}
      ],
      "regime": "TERM_SPREAD_POSITIVE",
      "vol_target": true
    },
    "auxiliary_predictions": [
      {"type": "regime_interaction", "regime": "TERM_SPREAD_NEGATIVE", "direction": "lower"},
      {"type": "international", "region": "developed_ex_us", "direction": "same_sign"},
      {"type": "correlation", "primitive": "NetPayoutYield", "bound": "below", "threshold": 0.3}
    ],
    "expected_annualized_sharpe": 0.53,
    "expected_decay_half_life_months": 14
  }
]}
